{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f297dcfc6704f75784f6755a8b3945f04143d6a93d3bf5560afc4fa58b6fabe1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000005:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dffeab3a68ad8b0c459edaf81db22ea5af58f232067b821ebbbb7f264a0c3a5b",
      "text": "……啊，是●●●●プロデューサー吗？\n在事务所收到的粉丝信我已经看完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007fb7aea2acf62d404379669ae7925a07c50410c72f17c35f454a6eccbf56e4",
      "text": "赶上这个时期，关于那个设施的CM和\n约会视频的感想挺多的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5afde5c8fb3583c487c70bf7a633b0189afaefb18d4046b4f67a2aeb42bf2cc",
      "text": "有人说看了我们的视频对设施产生了兴趣，\n也有人汇报说全家一起去玩了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2881a5adf968b19c618480c61a9da417dfa3d7f94df41df54206ff6672528f64",
      "text": "还有人说把它列入了下次约会的候选地，\n之类的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ed6620297b22e81e3e065de9f334594f85b50e826315a772bd0a3da947a88f5",
      "text": "如同主题一样，\n看来成功向各个年龄段的人做出了宣传。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f7c7b1fa169209f39cfa4da4c1b2bd69c060472ffbea0c1a0936676d49f558",
      "text": "工作大获成功了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9797c8372c10d40c19198835912ecc2c6cc7c0934d29d668f74deb9697ecee9",
      "text": "真令人开心呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8751f2e2d733113fbe946b7433558278c9d3bc0af2ccde489a97218b4a2279fb",
      "text": "啊。这多亏了那句凸显出我们风格的\n台词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86b3e93675875e92b38825764ab1b296c3a4c5f75b78d0727c1faf820a92cb1",
      "text": "能成为别人采取行动的契机，\n既让人高兴，又挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27f1439438e029968c36382ebbe597e9c76d64f482a699238dc51673e9992690",
      "text": "工作结束之后，\n也让我收获了很好的体验啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:044ame_302_2_3_044_02_09_a:2_3_044_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:726d696e0f5260d0d26ae0290392bfc16629d0463933d488f6ac2a56239e86dc",
      "text": "哎呀，不小心说长了。剩下的等下次\n见面再说吧。那么，回头见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
